Subject: [PATCH] Preserve the SDK toolchain and transport dependencies

Reason: Keep Go 1.27.0, gorilla/websocket v1.5.3, x/crypto v0.58.0 and x/sys v0.49.0 required by the preserved implementation, without changing the upstream module identity.
Origin: Extracted from published Chatanium DiscordGo SDK v0.30.0,
commit f2d1806d4599ff674163be703c0d62a23d4bb524, relative to upstream
f43dd94faaacd5b163e9e783f14b5bd8be639fc9.
Upstream-Status: Downstream; no upstream submission or acceptance is recorded
by this patch's source. No additional authorship or review is asserted.
Module: github.com/bwmarrin/discordgo (upstream identity retained)

diff --git a/go.mod b/go.mod
--- a/go.mod
+++ b/go.mod
@@ -1,5 +1,10 @@
 module github.com/bwmarrin/discordgo
 
-go 1.13
+go 1.27.0
 
-require github.com/gorilla/websocket v1.4.2
+require (
+	github.com/gorilla/websocket v1.5.3
+	golang.org/x/crypto v0.58.0
+)
+
+require golang.org/x/sys v0.49.0 // indirect
diff --git a/go.sum b/go.sum
--- a/go.sum
+++ b/go.sum
@@ -1,2 +1,6 @@
